      "writtenOn": "2021-09-14T22:40:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we\u0027re the source, then we should have (hopefully) gone to force sink by the time we can\u0027t supply Vconn which would force a severing of our previous connection via resistor change and Vbus discharge.\n\nPlus if we hard reset as a source, then Vconn would just come right back to us, which isn\u0027t what we want.",
